  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-question-index",
      "text": "DSH Web 客户端插件：**提问索引（Question Index）**。在会话右侧悬浮展示「用户提过的问题」的按序列表，可收起；点击某条问题即可把会话滚动跳转到对应的提问位置。\n\nA DSH client plugin that floats an ordered, collapsible list of the user's asked questions on the right side of the conversation, with click-to-jump into the flow."
    },
    {
      "section": "What it does",
      "text": "- A `shell.overlay` entry (root scope, floating layer) declares the\n  session-level seat `question-index.panel`.\n- The panel reads the current session's `chat` snapshot, walks nodes in\n  `chat.order` order, keeps only `user` / `steering` question nodes, extracts\n  their text blocks (`{ type: 'text' }` content) and renders an ordered list.\n- Clicking an item scrolls the conversation to that question via\n  `data-chat-anchor-key` inside `[data-conversation-scroll]` (same anchor\n  logic as `ChatView`).\n- The panel collapses to a slim right-edge strip and expands again; the\n  collapse state persists across session switches."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- Ordered question list (numbered from 1) for the active session\n- Click-to-jump into the conversation flow\n- Collapsible floating panel anchored to the right of the conversation\n- Collapse state preserved across session switches\n- Empty state: \"No questions yet\" when the session has no user questions\n- Localized (English / Simplified Chinese)\n- **Auto-indexes full history**: opening a session automatically pages through\n  its complete history, so old or never-visited sessions get every question in\n  the index with no manual scrolling.\n- **Durable local memory**: the index is persisted to localStorage, so it\n  survives page reloads and reopens."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "from npm (recommended: prebuilt, no build-approval step)",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-question-index"
    },
    {
      "section": "or from GitHub source",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:lijinhao315/dsh-question-index\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "```bash\nnpm install\nnpm run build   # tsc -p tsconfig.json && tsdown\n```\n\nOutputs `lib/index.js` (node half), `lib/invariant.js`, `lib/client.js`\n(browser half)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Known limitations",
      "text": "- Click-to-jump requires the target row to be rendered\n  (`data-chat-anchor-key` present in the DOM); unrendered rows are skipped.\n- Long entries render as a single truncated line; the full text is always\n  visible in the conversation body."
    },
    {
      "section": "Architecture",
      "text": "See [docs/architecture.md](docs/architecture.md) for how the plugin wires into\nthe DSH shell (overlay seat, panel contribution, module-table externals)."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
  ],
